00:15:57,860 --> 00:15:59,860
Ešte nevyleťela, tak to poviem.

358
00:15:59,860 --> 00:16:01,860
A tam to trva tých 60 rokov

359
00:16:01,860 --> 00:16:03,860
či kolko let Gyupiteru, takže

360
00:16:03,860 --> 00:16:05,860
Čo je to?

361
00:16:05,860 --> 00:16:07,860
Čo je to?

362
00:16:07,860 --> 00:16:09,860
Je možné, že

363
00:16:09,860 --> 00:16:11,860
