370
00:16:23,860 --> 00:16:27,330
častica, ktorá sa pojbe rýchlejšie

371
00:16:27,330 --> 00:16:29,330
ako svetlo.

372
00:16:29,330 --> 00:16:31,330
Čiže ak by si mal

373
00:16:31,330 --> 00:16:33,330
