394
00:17:14,330 --> 00:17:16,330
ktoré sa tvrdia.

395
00:17:16,330 --> 00:17:18,330
To je... Oni by také vedeli,

396
00:17:18,330 --> 00:17:20,330
že skoro ako ich vyšlož na cestu, tak sa vrátia.

397
00:17:20,330 --> 00:17:22,330
Že by v principi vedeli narušať

398
00:17:22,330 --> 00:17:24,330
kauzálnosť.

399
00:17:24,330 --> 00:17:26,330
Aj keď

400
00:17:26,330 --> 00:17:28,330
sú potom rôzne teórie,

401
00:17:28,330 --> 00:17:30,330
kde sú trošku ako, že skrotene,

402
00:17:31,330 --> 00:17:33,330
taky príklad.

403
00:17:33,330 --> 00:17:35,330
Takže, pomerne problematické

404
00:17:35,330 --> 00:17:37,330
