766
00:31:54,330 --> 00:31:56,330
dobrých a aj troška horších podkastov

767
00:31:56,330 --> 00:31:58,330
aj možno aj na tých troška horších.

768
00:31:58,330 --> 00:32:00,330
Majte sa veľmi pekný.

769
00:32:00,330 --> 00:32:02,330
Majte sa.

770
00:32:02,330 --> 00:32:06,120
Dobre, idieš spať.

771
00:32:06,120 --> 00:32:24,600
Som Jana Mačková

772
00:32:24,600 --> 00:32:26,600
